WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:04,000
Brother Qiang Brother Qiang

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Here we go, bro.

3
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:14,880
Brother, this is the wind harvest, brother

4
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:16,940
Where did you get so many prawns?

5
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,520
Brother Wang, don’t worry about where I got it from.

6
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:22,560
Just tell me

7
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:25,520
How much can you charge for this batch of defective goods, right?

8
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:28,110
Fortunately, I decisively put away my playfulness that time.

9
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:30,030
Another gift of fish clothes and another gift of sea crucian carp

10
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:32,110
Only then can we win it over, otherwise

11
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:34,110
It's not my turn to collect this batch of large prawns.

12
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:35,150
I accept other people’s prawns

13
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:36,870
First-class goods cost five yuan per kilogram.

14
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:37,830
Brother, here you are

15
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:38,950
I'll give you two cents per pound

16
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:41,470
How about it? It's interesting, okay?

17
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:43,030
Then call the workers over to move the goods.

18
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:52,940
Who is it? I wonder if you are so lucky?

19
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:53,900
Ugly, a bit unfamiliar

20
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:55,260
Doesn't seem to be from a nearby village

21
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:58,520
This man seems to be Wang Zhiqiang’s brother-in-law.

22
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:00,080
How is it possible for Brother Da Chibao?

23
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:01,640
Do you ugly hands look alike?

24
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:02,760
Then I don’t know

25
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:03,840
But a few days ago this person

26
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:06,520
I sold it to Wang Zhiqiang for several hundred kilograms of black eagles, real or fake.

27
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:18,890
Are you so lucky, bro?

28
00:01:18,890 --> 00:01:20,810
Three hundred and seventy-eight pounds of prawns, five yuan and two per pound

29
00:01:20,810 --> 00:01:22,770
A total of one thousand nine hundred and forty-five yuan and six, I'll give you the whole deal

30
00:01:22,770 --> 00:01:23,930
Just one thousand nine hundred and five.

31
00:01:23,930 --> 00:01:25,930
Although Big Wing Treasure is at Shelter Point Pier

32
00:01:25,970 --> 00:01:27,370
Always very impressive

33
00:01:27,370 --> 00:01:28,810
But when facing the God of Wealth

34
00:01:28,810 --> 00:01:31,210
You're still good at doing business, okay?

35
00:01:31,210 --> 00:01:33,760
Thank you, sister-in-law

36
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:44,430
The amount is ok

37
00:01:44,430 --> 00:01:52,140
This way you won’t be able to see that you are carrying the receipt with you.

38
00:01:52,140 --> 00:01:53,260
Go see what's going on
